1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,250
China pernah menembaki

2
00:00:01,270 --> 00:00:01,940
sebuah pulau

3
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,770
selama dua puluh tahun.

4
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:05,090
Tapi ada jadwalnya:

5
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:06,780
cuma di tanggal ganjil.

6
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,350
Nama pulaunya Kinmen.

7
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:09,650
Dikuasai Taiwan,

8
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:11,390
padahal cuma beberapa kilometer

9
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:12,960
dari daratan China.

10
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,160
Agustus 1958,

11
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,430
China menghujani Kinmen

12
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:17,480
dengan ratusan ribu

13
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:18,430
peluru meriam

14
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,330
selama 44 hari.

15
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,980
Lalu Menteri Pertahanan China

16
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,700
mengirim surat ke Taiwan.

17
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,810
Kira-kira isinya begini:

18
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:26,740
"Tanggal genap,

19
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,220
kami tidak menembak.

20
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,620
Silakan kirim beras,

21
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,850
sayur, dan minyak goreng

22
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:31,910
ke Kinmen."

23
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:33,210
Jadi tanggal genap,

24
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,260
kapal pembawa makanan datang.

25
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,350
Tanggal ganjil,

26
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:38,030
semua masuk bunker.

27
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:38,670
Imlek?

28
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:39,960
Libur menembak.

29
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:40,940
Lama-lama,

30
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:41,710
banyak pelurunya

31
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,580
tidak berisi bahan peledak.

32
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,710
Isinya selebaran propaganda.

33
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:47,760
Jadwal ini jalan terus

34
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:49,380
sampai 1979.

35
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,280
Totalnya,

36
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,640
hampir satu juta peluru

37
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:53,090
jatuh di Kinmen.

38
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:54,020
Sekarang,

39
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:54,910
besi peluru itu

40
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:56,890
ditempa jadi pisau dapur.

41
00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:57,550
Satu peluru

42
00:00:57,570 --> 00:00:59,510
bisa jadi puluhan pisau.

43
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:01,680
Yang mampir ke pabrik pisaunya?

44
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:04,580
Rombongan turis
dari China.
